::recipe

name: Basic Waffles
source: https://publicdomainrecipes.com/basic-waffles/
source author: logianer
source license: Public domain (Unlicense)
units: metric
category: breakfast
tags: waffles
dietary: vegetarian
yield: 19-20 waffles
active time: ~10m
total time: ~30m
image: basic-waffles-01.webp

::ingredients

(butter) 250g
(sugar) 200g
(vanilla) =
    (vanilla sugar) 2 packets / 16g
    -OR-
    (vanilla flavouring) as needed
(egg) 5
(flour) 500g
(baking powder) 2tbsp
(milk) 350-400ml

::equipment

(mixer)
(waffle maker)

::instructions

(egg) <beat, until creamy>

{egg mix} =
    (egg) +
    (sugar) +
    (vanilla)

{egg mix} <mix, gradually>

(butter) <melt>

{batter} =
    {egg mix} +
    (butter) +
    (baking powder)

Repeat [
    {batter} + (milk) some + (flour) some
        <stir>
]
until (milk) and (flour) used

{batter} <mix, mixer, high speed, until smooth>
    <rest, a couple of minutes>

Meanwhile [
    (waffle maker) <preheat>
]

Repeat [
    {batter} <pour, waffle maker>
        <bake, until golden brown>
]
until {batter} used
